# Renet returns "each other nonland permanent that entered this turn", a token among them: Bot2's Crustacean Commando enters and
# makes a Mutagen token, both entered this turn. Bot1 flashes in Renet: the Commando and the two Moxen go back to Bot2's hand,
# and the token, a token in a hand, ceases to exist (CR 111.7, 704.5d), so it is nowhere afterwards.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Renet, Temporal Apprentice
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Crustacean Commando
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Crustacean Commando.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
? Bot2.Battlefield.Count = 4
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Renet, Temporal Apprentice.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Battlefield.Count = 0
Bot2.Hand.Crustacean Commando.Power = 0
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Jet; Mox Sapphire; Renet, Temporal Apprentice
